  ('writing-just-for-fun', 304, 'Help a kid write the rules for a club that meets under the kitchen table.'),
  ('writing-just-for-fun', 305, 'Pause between sentences to look out the window, then write the next line about the first thing you see.'),
  ('writing-just-for-fun', 306, 'Fit a whole poem about your front steps or stairs onto one bookmark and tuck it into a book.'),
