  ('writing-just-for-fun', 308, 'Chronicle the adventures of a paper boat sailing down a gutter after a spring rain.'),
  ('writing-just-for-fun', 309, 'Plan a small treasure hunt at home, writing each clue as a silly order from a pirate captain.'),
