  ('writing-just-for-fun', 327, 'Hear the wind against your house or apartment at night and describe its voice.'),
  ('writing-just-for-fun', 328, 'Cast your neighbor''s cat as the hero of a sea adventure, written in a single happy paragraph.'),
  ('writing-just-for-fun', 329, 'Mark the first snow by writing a set of rules for a snowball fight that is entirely polite.'),
  ('writing-just-for-fun', 330, 'Fill the margin of a page with ten words that make you smile, then write one sentence using three of them.'),
